# Code owners for SwissYGO.
#
# Every pull request that touches ANY file automatically requests the repo owner
# as a reviewer (so there's no need to self-request). Combined with branch
# protection's "Require review from Code Owners", it also REQUIRES the owner's
# approval before a PR can merge — the owner is the single merge gate.
#
# The owner can't be auto-requested on their own PRs (GitHub won't request the
# author); PRs opened by the bot account (AriesYL) request the owner as expected.

